{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"275d4f60a19b8819","name":"card_unit_su_100","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/CovertOp/units/card_unit_su_100","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SU-100","text":"Has +4 attack if damaged.","flavorText":"The SU-100 was a highly effective Soviet tank destroyer that played a crucial role in the latter stages of WWII. It was built on the chassis of the T-34-85 medium tank and had a powerful 100mm D-10S gun mounted in a fixed casemate. This gun gave it the ability to penetrate the armor of almost any German tank it encountered, including the Tiger and Panther tanks. The SU-100 had a crew of 4 (Commander/Radio Operator, Gunner, Loader and Driver), and crews favored the SU-100 for its powerful armament, relatively low profile, and sloped armor, which provided decent protection. It saw extensive combat in the final offensives against the German army, and was also used in the Battle of Berlin because its gun could deal with heavy fortifications. A total of 4,976 SU-100’s were manufactured and it was in service in the Red Army until 1947.","faction":"Soviet","type":"tank","rarity":"Rare","cost":4,"operationCost":1,"attack":4,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_su_100","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_su_100_title","SourceString":"SU-100","LocalizedString":"SU-100"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::tank","attack":4,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_su_100_text","SourceString":"Has +4 attack if damaged.","LocalizedString":"Has +4 attack if damaged."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_su_100_history","SourceString":"The SU-100 was a highly effective Soviet tank destroyer that played a crucial role in the latter stages of WWII. It was built on the chassis of the T-34-85 medium tank and had a powerful 100mm D-10S gun mounted in a fixed casemate. This gun gave it the ability to penetrate the armor of almost any German tank it encountered, including the Tiger and Panther tanks. The SU-100 had a crew of 4 (Commander/Radio Operator, Gunner, Loader and Driver), and crews favored the SU-100 for its powerful armament, relatively low profile, and sloped armor, which provided decent protection. It saw extensive combat in the final offensives against the German army, and was also used in the Battle of Berlin because its gun could deal with heavy fortifications. A total of 4,976 SU-100’s were manufactured and it was in service in the Red Army until 1947.","LocalizedString":"The SU-100 was a highly effective Soviet tank destroyer that played a crucial role in the latter stages of WWII. It was built on the chassis of the T-34-85 medium tank and had a powerful 100mm D-10S gun mounted in a fixed casemate. This gun gave it the ability to penetrate the armor of almost any German tank it encountered, including the Tiger and Panther tanks. The SU-100 had a crew of 4 (Commander/Radio Operator, Gunner, Loader and Driver), and crews favored the SU-100 for its powerful armament, relatively low profile, and sloped armor, which provided decent protection. It saw extensive combat in the final offensives against the German army, and was also used in the Battle of Berlin because its gun could deal with heavy fortifications. A total of 4,976 SU-100’s were manufactured and it was in service in the Red Army until 1947."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Passive","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDealDamage"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Blitz"],"hasBlitz":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_su_100.t_su_100","SubPathString":""},"artist":"David Pentland","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/SU-100.S